            </physDesc>
            <notesStmt xml:id="notesStmt_N20338">
               <annot type="source_description" xml:id="annot_b5ff2086">
                  <p xml:id="idm59">No. 2 in this manuscript, which contains all six of the songs that Hartmann wrote for Musikforeningen's song contest in 1837. This copy is probably the one he handed in so as to prevent the jury from recognizing his handwriting, since the contributions were to be anonymous. Hartmann was chairman of Musikforeningen.</p>
               </annot>
            </notesStmt>
